NOTE ON SCOPE: RescueWay is a research/engineering prototype for emergency-
vehicle traffic-signal preemption, developed and evaluated in simulation
(a custom traffic simulator and SUMO) plus a hobbyist Arduino hardware rig.
It has not been validated on real traffic infrastructure, has not undergone
safety certification, and is not fit for deployment on a live traffic
intersection. See backend/ARCHITECTURE.md Part 8 §35 for the full readiness
assessment. The MIT license above governs use of the code; it is not a
representation that the system is safe or ready for real-world traffic
control.
